Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.30,0:04:14.34,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Nothing to see here, folks. Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.46,0:04:16.80,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Oh, my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.95,0:04:25.76,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Oh, it's just you, Kosei.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.95,0:04:27.66,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I thought I was in trouble for a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.66,0:04:30.04,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Oh, hey Tsubaki. When did you get up here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.59,0:04:31.98,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,What happened to the window?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.98,0:04:33.57,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Why is everything red?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.69,0:04:35.03,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,You broke it again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.33,0:04:37.28,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,But we only just got this window fixed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.46,0:04:40.60,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Every window I take out is another notch on the old bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.60,0:04:42.51,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Just hit him softer, please!
