Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.40,0:04:47.52,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,This is my last season in middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.77,0:04:49.44,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Gotta earn me a triple crown already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.49,0:04:51.56,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Let's just clean this up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.70,0:04:55.43,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Let me grab you the dustpan, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.43,0:04:58.19,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Guess I'll have to apologize again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.30,0:05:00.78,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,It did happen while I was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.28,0:05:07.16,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Don't pick it up with your hand, dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.60,0:05:09.41,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,What if you cut one of your fingers open?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.18,0:05:12.54,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Well, so what if I did?
