Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.74,0:05:22.13,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,You live right next to each other, been friends forever, and you seek each other out no matter where you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.48,0:05:23.73,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Just get married already.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.11,0:05:25.42,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Don't be an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.28,0:05:28.43,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,What are you doing up here with your cell phone, Watari?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.68,0:05:30.52,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Aren't you in the middle of soccer practice?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.52,0:05:32.25,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Please don't wear your cleats in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.56,0:05:36.77,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Man, that stupid vice principal chewed us out for a whole hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.77,0:05:38.31,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,He's just mad because he's bald.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.31,0:05:39.52,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Could have been worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.52,0:05:41.05,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,He could have chewed you out for two, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.17,0:05:44.03,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I didn't even do anything, and I had to suffer through all that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.03,0:05:45.36,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Clearly, I'm the victim here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:46.75,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,What? And I'm not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.75,0:05:50.82,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I'm not the one who built a school full of windows right\N next to where they have us play softball.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.94,0:05:52.11,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,They should have planned ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.74,0:05:53.89,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I dig all the windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.17,0:05:56.86,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Makes it easier for the girls inside to cheer for me.
