Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.98,0:06:04.62,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I'm gonna hit the convenience store.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.62,0:06:05.38,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,You in?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.46,0:06:06.02,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.16,0:06:07.28,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Only if you're buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.79,0:06:10.81,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I'm just saying I was bleeding all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.81,0:06:11.48,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Obviously, I-
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.48,0:06:11.95,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.95,0:06:13.43,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,This ice cream's delicious!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.43,0:06:14.38,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I'm stocking up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.69,0:06:15.82,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.36,0:06:19.74,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Dude, Kosei, it sucks to be you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.88,0:06:22.93,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,How come you gotta write two apology letters for one window?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.15,0:06:25.62,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,One for Tsubaki, and one for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.88,0:06:28.07,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I've been dealing with her antics since we were kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.22,0:06:29.94,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,So, I'm used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.04,0:06:32.42,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Breaking the suspension bridge on that field trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.42,0:06:35.35,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Oh, and shoving me off a high dive board into the pool.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.35,0:06:37.09,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,And that was just third grade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.69,0:06:39.12,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I thought I was gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.59,0:06:41.52,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.52,0:06:45.47,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Even though I'm an only child, \Nit's like I have my own high maintenance big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.47,0:06:47.16,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Kosei's a real prince, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.16,0:06:48.49,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,He's a real something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.87,0:06:51.72,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Careful, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.92,0:06:53.46,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Don't be too nice of a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.51,0:06:57.61,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Cause when it comes to the ladies, they usually finish up last.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.04,0:07:03.17,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Hey! I just got a text from Keiko!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.17,0:07:04.52,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I'll get you later, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:05.92,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,How many's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.92,0:07:07.19,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,She's three and counting.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.91,0:07:10.26,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I wonder, what do those girls see in him?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.80,0:07:12.42,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Ugh, he's so shallow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.53,0:07:14.39,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Yeah, but he is a good guy at heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.93,0:07:18.95,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Don't tell him that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.39,0:07:24.22,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.64,0:07:24.87,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.68,0:07:26.86,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,You crushing on anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.37,0:07:27.59,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.44,0:07:29.86,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Miwa told me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.96,0:07:35.10,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,She told me, when you're in love, the world\N just starts looking more colorful.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.38,0:07:42.57,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I don't think I'll ever inspire that kind of change in someone.
