Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.65,0:07:44.69,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Stop that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.89,0:07:46.27,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,You're 14 years old!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.40,0:07:47.92,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,There's no sparkle in your eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.02,0:07:48.76,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,What the hell?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.82,0:07:49.69,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,My eyes are dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.69,0:07:51.48,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I don't think they're gonna sparkle that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.48,0:07:52.98,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Don't you throw logic at me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.22,0:07:54.72,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,You know what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.87,0:07:57.12,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,You're supposed to be out footloose and fancy-free!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.30,0:07:59.70,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Those eyes should be like Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.26,0:08:02.55,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,But yours are blah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.87,0:08:04.15,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.13,0:08:07.22,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I see that sparkle in your eyes all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.91,0:08:14.32,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,For Tsubaki, I bet the world looks pretty colorful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.53,0:08:16.25,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,How could it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.63,0:08:19.45,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Must be nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.34,0:08:24.09,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,So when does your dad get back into town?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.38,0:08:26.58,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Uh, I think he'll be back in a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.78,0:08:27.39,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Maybe two.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.66,0:08:28.87,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Kinda up in the air, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.13,0:08:30.76,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,It depends on the clients, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.30,0:08:32.01,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,That makes sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.66,0:08:34.76,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,He knows your family's keeping an eye out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.14,0:08:37.26,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,And I am pretty used to being on my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.96,0:08:39.07,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Well, see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.66,0:08:40.60,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Yep, see ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.73,0:08:45.38,Tsubaki_1 1-6,,0,0,0,,Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.90,0:08:47.23,Tsubaki_1 1-6,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.73,0:08:48.76,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Nah, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.16,0:08:51.52,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I was gonna ask him and then I totally zoned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.45,0:08:54.10,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I'll do it tomorrow, promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.65,0:08:57.03,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Stop being a spaz.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.11,0:08:58.55,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,It's gonna work out just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.34,0:09:00.48,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Yeah, for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.93,0:09:01.62,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.14,0:09:03.07,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I got you covered.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.81,0:09:17.85,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Hey there, Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.00,0:09:19.46,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I'm home.
