Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.53,0:09:40.85,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Miwa told me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.39,0:09:46.85,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,The moment I laid eyes on him, my old life just flew away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.78,0:09:56.28,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Everything I saw and heard, everything I felt, the world around me took on color in a way I never knew it could.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.71,0:09:58.24,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,But
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.09,0:10:00.08,Kosei_1  1-3,,0,0,0,,in my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.37,0:10:04.14,Kosei_1  1-3,,0,0,0,,life comes through in monotone,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.96,0:10:07.01,Kosei_1  1-3,,0,0,0,,black and white
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.97,0:10:09.08,Kosei_1  1-3,,0,0,0,,like piano keys
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.32,0:10:26.48,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,There, in that moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.91,0:10:28.94,Kosei_1  1-3,,0,0,0,,I knew
