Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.02,0:10:56.66,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,What I do? Who? How?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.10,0:11:00.51,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Man, it wouldn't have killed you to catch the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:02.91,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Why are you sitting here all by yourself, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.91,0:11:04.74,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,You're young, live a little!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.89,0:11:06.26,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Gimmie.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.16,0:11:09.36,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Sitting alone in the classroom after school?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.36,0:11:10.45,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,You're hopeless.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.56,0:11:12.36,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,So what's on your playlist, Hermit?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.36,0:11:13.74,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,That's not very hygienic.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.45,0:11:17.28,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,No way! This is that new song from Goose House!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:19.47,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,It's in that new commercial! They're playing all the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.08,0:11:20.98,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Excited much?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.71,0:11:36.10,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's Saturday, so I'm guessing you're free, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.44,0:11:38.06,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,You can't just assume that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.34,0:11:40.22,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Tell me about your big plans.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.39,0:11:44.52,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,So, you know how girls go nuts for Watari?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.79,0:11:47.59,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Well, there's this one in my class who really wants to meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.29,0:11:50.14,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,And so, we're gonna hang out tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.83,0:11:51.59,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,You wanna come with?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.24,0:11:54.44,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,What? And be the third wheel?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.62,0:11:57.58,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,If this girl and Watari hit it off, I'm gonna be the third wheel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.83,0:11:58.51,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.81,0:12:01.78,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,But if we're a group of four, you and me can be wheels together!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.99,0:12:03.11,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,It'll be perfect!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.30,0:12:05.46,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,And besides...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.11,0:12:07.76,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I hear...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.48,0:12:10.54,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,That the girl's a classical musician.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.80,0:12:14.03,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,You play the piano, and she plays the whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.10,0:12:16.36,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,So if the conversation lags, it's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.79,0:12:18.77,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,You can talk about the composers you like.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.90,0:12:21.14,Kaori_4 21-22,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Give Watari a chance to reset his brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.12,0:12:23.76,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.88,0:12:26.38,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I gave up on the piano.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.92,0:12:28.62,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I haven't played it in two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.40,0:12:33.24,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,You were playing it in the music room yesterday, you big liar!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.42,0:12:34.68,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,That was just for work!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.75,0:12:35.75,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Yeah, for reals?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.86,0:12:38.00,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I'm transcribing pop songs by ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.13,0:12:40.07,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,For karaoke and stuff like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.75,0:12:43.79,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,You're doing that just fine right here, without a piano.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.57,0:12:46.59,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I was double-checking some parts, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.52,0:12:48.10,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.24,0:12:51.78,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Lots of non-musical jobs out there, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.72,0:12:54.76,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Do you want the truth?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.01,0:12:58.80,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,It feels like you're clinging on to it any way that you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.54,0:13:03.93,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I don't want to sound mean, but \Nyou were cooler back when you played, Kosei.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.12,0:13:07.30,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,It was my mother's dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.27,0:13:10.89,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Raise me to become a pianist.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.97,0:13:12.99,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,A world-class one.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.35,0:13:17.35,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,She ran a music school, and I took lessons from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.16,0:13:20.00,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Day after day, for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.84,0:13:21.88,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,She would yell at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.60,0:13:23.56,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,She'd even hit me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.54,0:13:26.67,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Even when I cried, she wouldn't let up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.81,0:13:30.06,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I never got to make it big in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.40,0:13:32.58,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,That's why you're going in my place.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.97,0:13:39.55,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,If my going to Europe will make you happy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.03,0:13:42.08,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,If you think it'll make you well again
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.62,0:13:43.37,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Then I
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.58,0:13:44.91,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.54,0:13:47.72,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Three years ago
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.98,0:13:50.45,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,right when I was on the cusp of making that happen
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.72,0:13:52.81,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,My mother died.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.58,0:13:57.70,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I hate the piano...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.12,0:14:00.64,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,But I'm still clinging to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.58,0:14:02.29,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I guess
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.12,0:14:04.41,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,It's all I have left.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.57,0:14:07.08,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Take away the piano...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.57,0:14:08.52,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,And there's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.89,0:14:11.85,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Just the echo of a misplayed key.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.56,0:14:25.93,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I wish he'd play it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.46,0:14:33.27,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.53,0:14:35.72,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I'm the first one here just like always.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.07,0:14:36.97,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.20,0:14:40.48,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Who leaves their shoes
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.82,0:14:41.69,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,up in a tree?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.59,0:14:45.82,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,These always looked so... perilous.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.39,0:14:48.33,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.36,0:14:50.04,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.36,0:14:53.00,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,These are leggings!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.56,0:14:59.75,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,A melodica.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.47,0:15:01.83,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,And they're not half bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.62,0:15:05.56,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Miwa told me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.64,0:15:10.44,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,The moment I laid eyes on him, my old life just blew away.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.34,0:15:13.44,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Everything I saw and heard,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.44,0:15:14.86,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,everything I felt,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.28,0:15:19.70,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,the world around me took on color
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.70,0:15:21.82,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,in a way I never knew it could.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.32,0:15:25.02,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,The whole world began to sparkle!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.59,0:16:08.70,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,She's crying...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.29,0:16:12.83,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,That's what I get for overdoing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.49,0:16:16.11,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,We didn't see any of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.41,0:16:18.28,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,When are the pigeons gonna show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.39,0:16:19.10,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,They didn't come?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.34,0:16:20.48,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I wonder why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.91,0:16:23.15,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,It's gotta be a bugle or it won't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.35,0:16:25.07,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Don't you mean it's gotta be a trumpet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.13,0:16:26.69,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,That's kinda like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.79,0:16:31.08,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,It could be a sousaphone for all those silly old pigeons are gonna care.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.43,0:16:33.15,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,What matters is we play as one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.26,0:16:34.96,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.32,0:16:37.46,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.01,0:17:17.88,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Just look at them go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.42,0:17:26.42,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Like something out of a fairytale.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.87,0:17:48.46,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Bye-bye, Mr. Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.51,0:17:50.84,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Aw, that was my favorite one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.47,0:17:53.55,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,It's flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.80,0:18:12.33,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,What the hell kind of pervert are you \Ntaking a picture of me with my skirt pulling up?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.33,0:18:13.89,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat you black and blue!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.89,0:18:15.50,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,What? And you stole my leggings?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.50,0:18:17.58,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,That's it, pervert! No mercy for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.49,0:18:21.75,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,If you think I'll let you get away with this, you're an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.56,0:18:25.04,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I didn't steal them! They were up a tree!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.04,0:18:26.88,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,That was my melodica!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.40,0:18:28.63,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,And my recorder!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.42,0:18:31.10,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Oh, no sign of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.34,0:18:33.21,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,You think they're waiting for us in the wrong spot?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.57,0:18:35.39,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Okay, Tsubaki, level with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.70,0:18:37.22,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Is this girl cute or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.31,0:18:40.90,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I mean, you said she is, but you're another girl, so who knows?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.07,0:18:42.64,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Ah, now we're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.10,0:18:45.22,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Kaori! Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.91,0:18:47.54,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Oh, Tsubaki!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.12,0:18:54.12,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I guess it's time for you guys to meet one another.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.23,0:18:57.30,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,First up, my classmate Kaori Miyazono.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.30,0:18:58.54,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Told you she was cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.33,0:19:02.22,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,It is so nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.03,0:19:05.36,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,And Ryota Watari.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.52,0:19:07.03,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,He's captain of the soccer team.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.11,0:19:08.10,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Crazy, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.33,0:19:09.78,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Pleasure's all mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.92,0:19:12.62,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Jackpot Tsubaki! She's adorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.95,0:19:14.60,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Can you believe we haven't met before?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.60,0:19:16.43,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I know! What are the odds?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.86,0:19:20.77,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Creepy. She went from harpy to girly girl in no time flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.82,0:19:24.53,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Not that it really matters, but the quiet \None over here is {\b1}friend A.{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.79,0:19:28.34,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.41,0:19:30.63,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I do hope you can find it in your heart to forgive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.88,0:19:33.56,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,One word out of you about that panty shot and you're dead!
