Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.73,0:19:38.58,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Check it out, she's super polite!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.58,0:19:41.48,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Don't be silly, that was just me being me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.48,0:19:43.11,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Naughty, naughty, Kosei.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.63,0:19:46.26,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Getting here before we did so you could meet her first.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.40,0:19:48.14,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,You're entirely too clever.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.14,0:19:50.12,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Whatever you're insinuating, cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.12,0:19:51.74,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Someone's all touchy today.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.70,0:19:55.77,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,But even if you did like her, though,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.81,0:19:57.90,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,she's totally interested in Watari.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.60,0:20:00.81,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Good thing you're only out here in a supporting role.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.98,0:20:03.85,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Kosei Arima as the ever-dependable friend A.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.00,0:20:05.01,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Don't you forget it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.01,0:20:07.16,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Oh, give it a rest. That girl's not my type.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.06,0:20:09.05,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Look at the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.15,0:20:10.63,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I'd better get in there already!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.95,0:20:12.14,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Where you running off to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.19,0:20:13.07,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Behind ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.91,0:20:19.05,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,That building, it's
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.11,0:20:19.96,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Towa Hall!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.70,0:20:24.79,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,If you wanna find me, look on stage.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.76,0:20:26.64,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I'll be there!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.02,0:20:28.34,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Playing this violin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.52,0:20:36.26,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,You can play that thing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.30,0:20:37.70,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,That is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.95,0:20:38.63,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Yup!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.82,0:20:41.10,Tsubaki_1 1-6,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Kosei, we gotta go!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.34,0:20:46.06,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Nah...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.90,0:20:47.85,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.32,0:20:57.64,Kaori_1 1-4,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,You should come along!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.98,0:21:11.68,Kosei_1  1-3,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,Spring is blooming all around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.52,0:21:13.58,Default,It was you; it was you who enlightened me,0,0,0,,And I...
